                <div class="toggle-desc">World State reads, NPC scans, image prompts, the Story Director and Chomusuke's jobs. <b>Off by default:</b> background jobs ask for low reasoning effort, since their prompts already tell the model how to think, and a reasoning model that thinks for minutes over a long job can make the provider drop the request. On: they use your connection's own reasoning settings.</div>
